    "note": "Draft dated 2023-08-17 (as filed, special-session number). Section 49-50-803 is the private-school handgun carry policy section (per the state summary); the bill text itself does not mention handguns. The state's summary calls it 'as introduced'; the HB has one vote recorded (2023-08-28) so amendments may not be in the text read. The same change was enacted in 2024 as Public Chapter 738 (HB 1631 / SB 1708)."
  },
  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (TCA 49-50-803): is amended by deleting the language \"K-12\" wherever it appears in the section.\nSECTION 2 (TCA 49-50-803, new subsection (f)): (f) As used in this section, \"private school\" means a private school as defined in § 49-6-3001(c) that serves students in any of the grades pre-kindergarten through twelve (pre-K-12)."
}